Okay.

00:23:25.700 --> 00:23:28.720
You can go back to work
whenever you feel like.

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:29.830
Thanks.

00:23:54.860 --> 00:24:03.100
You try to make it look
as if nothing is wrong.

00:24:04.600 --> 00:24:11.670
The Knife of love won't show any mercy.

00:24:12.410 --> 00:24:20.910
You just hold back your feelings
and live each and everyday.

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:28.930
You say you're used to it or
there's nothing you can do.

00:24:30.730 --> 00:24:34.290
We should be much
more straightforward...

00:24:35.070 --> 00:24:38.430
...and hug each other real tight.

00:24:38.970 --> 00:24:43.570
Even if we're feeling
awkward at times...

00:24:43.810 --> 00:24:51.880
On the night when I dream
as many times as I shed tears...

00:24:52.550 --> 00:25:00.820
...l'm sure an angel will smile at me.

00:25:01.290 --> 00:25:09.500
Let's dream of all the stars in the sky.

00:25:10.000 --> 00:25:18.430
I hope you keep on smiling.

00:25:18.810 --> 00:25:26.880
Let's dream of all the stars in the sky.
